WEBVTT

00:00:08.301 --> 00:00:09.536
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Part 4

00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:21.482
About a year later, Judge Kelly met Inspector McCleary.

00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:26.455
“Nice weather we’re having,” said the judge.

00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:31.339
“By the way, how’s Mrs. McCleary?”

00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:35.411
Inspector McCleary looked sad.

00:00:36.323 --> 00:00:38.896
“Well, sir,” he said,

00:00:39.383 --> 00:00:44.819
“Mrs. McCleary…the thing is… she left me.”

00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:49.340
“No! Really?” said the judge.

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:53.803
“I thought she was a wonderful young woman.”

00:00:54.718 --> 00:00:59.159
“That was just the problem,” said McCleary sadly.

00:00:59.812 --> 00:01:02.385
“A young man fell in love with her.

00:01:03.231 --> 00:01:06.543
He was a millionaire businessman from Melbourne.

00:01:07.207 --> 00:01:10.954
They left for Australia last week.”